  "digest": "# INFRASTRUCTURES \u2014 sector digest, ISO week 2026-W44\n\n**Coverage published.** Only POWER_UTILITIES is live: CDIA at REDUCE, target Rp287 against Rp362 (-20.5%) [CDIA report, coverage index]. It is the desk's sole published name; TELCO 0/15, TOWERS 0/7, TOLL_ROADS 0/7, POWER_UTILITIES 1/9 and CONSTRUCTION 0/28 remain queued.\n\n**Changes.** CDIA was initiated on 29 October at SELL, target Rp311, then moved to REDUCE, target Rp287, in the 30 October Q3 update. Revenue rose 16.4% year on year to US$122m on time-charter logistics, while reported net profit fell 61%: last year's one-off other gain did not repeat, finance costs rose and fair-value income was flat [CDIA report, S17]. Management's EBITDA headline was discounted as largely non-operating \u2014 associate income, FX and fair-value gains.\n\n**Deck moves.** No Infrastructures deck moved this week: none of the five sector decks is built in fund record yet, so no sector driver carries a sourced path. The macro deck remains the only reviewed input the desk can lean on (usd_idr FY2027E 18,350; BI rate 5.75; both reviewed 24 October) [macro deck]. Building the sector deck is the gating item for the queue.\n\n**Material news.** The Q3 wave: PGEO net profit +21.4%, MTEL Rp1.55trn, JSMR Rp2.7trn, ISAT Rp4.9trn, WIKA sales Rp15.8trn (+11.9%), with IPCM and TOTL revenue higher. ARKO was suspended after a sharp share fall; PTPP stays suspended through its Rp18.2trn debt restructuring; WIKA and Danantara continued subsidiary divestments; TOWR receives a Rp176bn interim dividend from Protelindo; MTEL's MESOP stage III starts 1 November; Komdigi kept three operators in its 700MHz/2.6GHz process and is reviewing operator cost burdens [news triage 2026-10-25/30].\n\n**Watch next week.** TLKM, EXCL, TOWR and TBIG Q3 prints; the 2 November IDX30 change (ISAT in) and HSC exclusion (BREN); ARKO and PTPP suspension news; CDIA's refinancing calendar and March-2027 float step; and the parked names \u2014 BREN after two failed QC audits, JKON until CONSTRUCTION opens.\n\n*Research only; not a recommendation to act.*",
  "digest_file": "fund record"
}